sequenceDiagram
    participant Platform as opendatahub-operator
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant AGO as ai-gateway-operator<br/>8081/TCP HTTP (probes)
    participant Kustomize as Kustomize Renderer<br/>(in-memory)
    participant BGO as batch-gateway-operator
    participant MaaS as maas-controller
    participant Webhook as maas-controller-webhook<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS

    Note over Platform,K8sAPI: Flow 1: AIGateway CR Reconciliation
    Platform->>K8sAPI: Create AIGateway CR<br/>(batchGateway=Managed, modelsAsAService=Managed)
    K8sAPI->>AGO: Watch event: AIGateway CR<br/>SA token auth
    AGO->>Kustomize: Render vendored manifests<br/>(kustomize overlays for RHOAI)
    Kustomize-->>AGO: Rendered resources
    AGO->>K8sAPI: Server-Side Apply (SSA)<br/>batch-gateway-operator resources<br/>SA token auth
    AGO->>K8sAPI: Server-Side Apply (SSA)<br/>maas-controller resources<br/>SA token auth
    AGO->>K8sAPI: Create infra namespace<br/>redhat-ai-gateway-infra + RBAC
    AGO->>K8sAPI: Update AIGateway status<br/>(BatchGatewayReady, ModelsAsAServiceReady)

    Note over Platform,Webhook: Flow 2: MaaS Teardown Protocol
    Platform->>K8sAPI: Update AIGateway CR<br/>(modelsAsAService=Removed)
    K8sAPI->>AGO: Watch event: AIGateway CR update
    AGO->>K8sAPI: Annotate maas-controller Deployment<br/>teardown-requested=true
    K8sAPI->>MaaS: Detect teardown annotation
    MaaS->>K8sAPI: Delete Config/default CR<br/>(anchor resource)
    MaaS->>K8sAPI: Clean up runtime resources<br/>(HTTPRoutes, AuthPolicies, etc.)
    MaaS->>K8sAPI: Annotate own Deployment<br/>teardown-completed=true
    K8sAPI->>AGO: Detect completion annotation<br/>(maasAwareGCPredicate)
    AGO->>K8sAPI: GC action: delete MaaS resources<br/>(label: app.kubernetes.io/component=models-as-a-service)

    Note over K8sAPI,Webhook: Flow 3: Webhook Admission Validation
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-maas-*<br/>443/TCP HTTPS (serving-cert)
    Webhook->>Webhook: Validate AITenant /<br/>MaaSSubscription / MaaSAuthPolicy
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission Response<br/>(Allow/Deny)
